    "body": "> I think so far we've been using no distinguished font for Ecma enums?\r\n\r\nI didn't do a complete audit but the first spot I found ([the `thisMode` argument to OrdinaryFunctionCreate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#getting-the-current-value-of-the-event-handler)) indeed uses no font, so that sounds plausible. Pushed up a commit making that change.",
